{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":43,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܥܒ݂ܘܿܕ ܕܝܼܘܵܢܝܼ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܘܫܩܘܿܠܔ ܬܘܼܥܠܝܼ ܡ̣ܢ ܐܘܼܡܬܵ‌ܐ ܠܵܐ ܡܗܘܼܡܸܢܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡ̣ܢ ܐܢܵܫܵܐ ܕܦܸܠܡܵܐ ܘܥܵܘܠܵܐ ܦܲܨܝܼ ܠܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܐܲܢ݇ܬ ܝܼܘܸܬ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܕܚܲܝܠܝܼ؛ ܩܵܡܘܿܕܝܼ ܡܘܼܚܦܸܠܔ ܠܘܼܟ݂ ܐܸܠܝܼ؟","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܵܡܘܿܕܝܼ ܚܵܕܪܹܢ ܒܸܥܒ݂ܵܕܵܐ ܐܸܒ݂ܠܵܐ ܒܡܲܠܝܲܨܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢ؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܲܕܸܪ ܒܲܗܪܘܼܟ݂ ܘܫܲܪܝܼܪܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂، ܐܵܢܝܼ ܒܸܬ ܡܕܲܒܪܝܼ ܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܡܲܝܬ‌ܝܼ ܠܝܼ ܠܛܘܼܪܵܐ ܕܩܘܼܕܫܘܼܟ݂ ܘܠܡܲܫܟܢܘܼ̈ܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗ̇ܝܓܵܗ ܒܸܬ ܐܵܬܹܝܢ ܠܡܲܕܒܚܵܐ ܕܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܟܸܣ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܕܪܲܒܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܦܨܵܚܬ‌ܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܸܬ ܫܲܟܪܸܢܘܼܟ݂ ܒܟܸܢܵܪܵܐ، ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܐܲܠܵܗ‌ܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܵܡܘܿܕܝܼ ܟܝܼܦܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܘܲܬ‌ܝ، ܝܵܐ ܓܵܢܝܼ؟","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܩܵܡܘܿܕܝܼ ܫܓ݂ܝܼܫܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܘܲܬ‌ܝ ܒܓܵܘܝܼ؟","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܦܘܿܪܝ ܠܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܣܵܒܵܒ ܡܸܢܕܪܸܫ ܒܸܬ ܫܲܟܪܸܢܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܦܵܪܘܿܩܝܼ ܘܐܲܠܵܗ‌ܝܼ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/43.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/44.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/42.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}